WEBVTT

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:56.030
"Attack of the Wolf"

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.980
Sorry! Are you okay?

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.760
What a relief.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.840
Why did you interfere with my landing?

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.290
I thought I'd try to catch you.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.040
Are you here for the society's party, too?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.910
Ryuji-kun, over here.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.720
Eriko-san, don't you think that's a little revealing?

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:17.080
Oh, come on. It's a party.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.410
Ryuji!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.470
How is my dress?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.390
It's really cute. You look good.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.820
Really?

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.400
There's lots of people.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.850
Hold on to this.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.950
What for?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:50.550
This party's a place to show off Lost Preciouses. It'll get you noticed.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:54.200
You're a level 10 breaker, but you're not registered with the society.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.650
No one here knows you.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.510
Sorry, I don't want to stand out.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:04.420
If you consider your future, you've got to make an impression at these events.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.190
Escort me.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.260
Me, too.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.720
Shaggy.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.670
Hey.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:20.610
That's Baron Bluebeard, a collector of A Class and up Lost Preciouses.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:23.650
He's an unpleasant man who conducts his business through force and money.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:30.260
Makihara-san is an unfortunate collector who lost his collection more than ten years ago.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:34.000
They say he lost his child at the same time.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.830
He's been out of the loop for some time because of his emotional scars.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.760
That's Ishizu-san.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.860
He collects Lost Preciouses related to fortune telling.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:48.080
There's all sorts of people here.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.820
You're Nanao Eriko-san, aren't you?

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:56.060
I am Saeki. I am a new collector.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.530
Your column made quite an impression.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.790
Column?

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.770
Eriko!

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.470
When did you do this?

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:06.530
Have you begun hunting for your collection?

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.790
I've already recovered one piece.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.790
An A Class?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.790
It's called True Love.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:18.560
I can't do anything without both, but I haven't found the other yet.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.220
Are you not familiar with it?

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:23.750
You'll have to escuse me. I'm a new collector.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:28.040
However, I'm surprised to see three A Classes in this place.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:32.090
I thought it was only the baron's lamp and the madam's ring.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.010
I asked them not to print it.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:39.600
Unlike Hozumi-san, I don't have body guards.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.320
A wolf!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.930
What is this?

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:44.540
It's Odd Eye.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:49.320
She's a wanted criminal who steals Lost Preciouses of A Class and above.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.320
What's with the ears and tail?

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.170
Perhaps it's meant to be camouflage.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:57.890
By drawing attention to them, she creates a less clear physical impression.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:02.550
I see. That explains why the eyewitness accounts are so limited.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.670
Yes.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:08.170
Could I get your contact information?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:08.940
What?

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:12.530
If I hear anything about the other earring, I'll let you know.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.000
How considerate.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.870
I must be going. It was an honor to speak with you.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:36.280
Excuse me.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.520
We met earlier, didn't we?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.030
I knew you were coming to this party.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:45.930
Yes.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:47.210
You're a collector?

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.180
No.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.930
Then you're a breaker, too?

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:53.030
You're one, too?

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.840
Huh? Yeah.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:03.660
Hozumi-sama, please don't do that.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:07.110
I'll pay for it. Send me the bill later.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:20.630
Ryuji-kun, who was that girl?

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.670
I don't know!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.580
Cheater!

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:28.750
No, I'm not! Calm down!

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.100
Get her! Go, go, go!

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:00.930
Stop, thief!

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:20.790
Get her!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:59.430
You're Odd Eye?

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.480
Damn beast!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.500
Wait!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.880
Get her!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.260
Kisaragi!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.510
Don't let her escape!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.570
Calm down! Turn on the lights!

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:40.550
Damn it! Why did you help her? Are you working with Odd Eye?

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:45.060
I'm not! I just don't think it's right to hit a girl with a night stick.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.180
I'm sorry.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.950
We'll talk later. Don't move.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:54.620
Call the front! Lock down the area around the hotel!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.100
Are you all right?

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:55.800
Any injuries?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:56.750
I'm fine, thank you.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:08.860
I'm exhausted! I can't believe we spent the whole day being questioned!

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.320
Well, we did help her.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:15.930
A lot happened, but the party itself was pretty fun, wasn't it?

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.650
You're right.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.860
Thanks for protecting this.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:25.240
What can that earring do?

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:29.680
This thing has the power to hear the truth.

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:34.380
If you listen to someone while wearing both of them, you'll read their mind.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:35.980
That's amazing.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:39.000
With only one, it's just an ordinary earring.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.810
Only female breakers can use them.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.420
Only women?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:49.150
Rumors say only a woman trying to read her love's mind can use it.

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:56.970
People say it's because the original owner lost faith in men, but none of it's hard fact.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:00.580
We won't know until we have both of them.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.640
Ryuji.

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:22.860
Don't cheat.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:45.860
Stop!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:48.010
What?

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.430
Ryuji-kun, get out of the way!

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:57.890
What are you doing?

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:59.640
What is this?

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:02.240
It's a trap I got from Tokura-san.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.600
He said he made it from a Lost Precious.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.960
It's your fault for standing there!

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:09.320
Your control is terrible!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.680
Ryuji, cheater!

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.360
I'm not!

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.400
Let go! What is this?

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:30.420
Looks like it's strong enough.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:33.800
If you don't let me go, I'll tear out his carotid artery!

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.760
I won't let you do that.

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.090
Eriko-san, stop her!

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.380
Okay!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.910
I'm letting Ryuji-kun go. Calm down, okay?

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:49.690
Unlock.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.130
Ryuji.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.370
Huh?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.530
What?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:58.880
What is this?

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:12.510
No!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:17.360
I can't remove it with the incantation.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.320
What? It's a prototype? Wait, Tokura-san!

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:25.040
He said it might come off in a day.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:29.820
It'll be okay. It means we'll have that much time.

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:34.860
I've got a lot of questions for you, Odd Eye.

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:38.190
I won't talk! You'll never break me!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.860
Stop!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.500
Are these ears real?

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:58.200
Feel like talking yet? First, how old are you?

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:01.060
15.

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.420
What about school?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.750
I don't go.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:07.580
You steal Lost Preciouses at such a tender young age.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.280
Who's making you do it?

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.730
Are you being threatened?

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.020
No. It was my decision.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.090
I don't believe it.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.460
You wouldn't understand, you society lapdogs!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.470
What sort of idiot put you up to this?

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:27.480
They must be trash to make a child steal.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.200
Don't insult my master!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.200
Master?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.570
He's making you commit crimes, is he? He doesn't even let you go to school.

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:37.610
School, huh?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.970
Take a look at this mark on my arm and this body of a beast.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:44.370
My own parents abandoned me, but he raised me.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.020
Cursed blood flows in my veins.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:52.690
When I get excited, I turn into a half-human, half-beast.

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.390
She's talking lots.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.130
Is that possible?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.260
I don't know.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:02.160
Why does your master want my earring?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.380
Let's keep going, then.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.420
Stop it!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.730
Eriko-san!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:20.900
Is this alcohol?

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:22.010
I feel gross.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.490
It's sticky.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.740
There's only one thing to do.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.620
Why is this happening?

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:29.840
There's nothing we can do about it while you're connected.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.010
Don't touch me.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:34.260
I can't clean you without touching you. Now, be good.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.610
Just get it over with quickly!

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:39.040
I'll clean you, Ryuji.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.020
I'll do it myself!

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.040
Nope!

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:54.650
I thought I was going to die.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.290
Ryuji?

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.760
Am I going to die?

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.780
That was fun.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.700
Why are you so energetic?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.520
Face the other way.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.850
Fluffy...

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:16.020
Fluffy!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.010
Fluffy moves!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.420
It feels so nice.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.800
It really does.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.030
Stop... Stop it.

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:35.740
Don't do things she doesn't like.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.370
Okay.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:43.400
What's your name? "Odd Eye" can't be your real name.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.470
My master calls me Ai.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.000
Then that's what we'll call you.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:57.440
Why don't you have any problem touching me? Doesn't it bother you?

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:59.540
Fluffy feels good.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:00.760
That's not what I mean.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:04.890
Can't you see this power of the beast and this strange mark?

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:07.310
So? Take a look at Rose.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.000
See?

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.870
What are those?

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.660
Rose is a red dragon.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:14.620
A dragon?

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.500
Ryuji, look.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.460
That's amazing! When did you learn to do that?

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:26.130
I wanted to surprise you.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.500
Are you okay, Rose?

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.170
Do you believe me?

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.410
She's got the mark of a dragon on her hand, too.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.110
Beautiful, isn't it? It's just like yours.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:46.820
You can't get me to like you. I only trust my master.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:51.920
But he's making you steal. Don't you think he's using you?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:56.520
No! I agree with my master's philosophy! It's my decision!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.760
You shouldn't be living in such an environment!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.570
You should leave your master!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:05.560
Shut up! Shut up, or I'll tear your throat out!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:09.900
You wouldn't do that. You saved a kitten.

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:11.610
That was...

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:15.700
That's not all. You protected that old woman at the party.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.210
You're not a bad kid.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.070
I think you're a kind girl.

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:24.700
What... What are you...

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:30.680
Ryuji, look!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.240
Rose, that's enough!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.500
Ouch.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.450
Are you okay?

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:49.710
How much alcohol have you been hiding?

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:56.450
Are you awake? Are you okay?

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:00.070
I'm sorry. Does it hurt?

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.020
No.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:04.510
Good.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:08.640
You're up.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.310
Here, drink this.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.460
Is it poisoned?

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.550
What are you talking about? Ryuji-kun made it.

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.500
I just heated it up.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:22.560
He wouldn't do that.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.430
I might, though.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.410
While it's still warm.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.720
I'm not hungry.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.480
I'm not hungry!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.080
Okay, but eat it anyway.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:38.020
I don't want it!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:43.070
What was that weird noise? I'm scared.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:46.720
I hope you'll eat this so Rose won't be scared.

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:48.800
I guess I don't have a choice.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.320
This is an exception!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.810
His name is Furumori, 55 in the photo.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:57.870
He's a level 9 breaker and a professional Lost Precious researcher.

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:03.530
I think he's behind this. He was an exceptional researcher.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:10.360
He entered forbidden territory in his research and injured more than 20 people beyond recovery...

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:12.940
and disappeared with a number of Lost Preciouses.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:17.770
Supposing he is her master, what does he want?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.380
I do not know.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:24.540
Information on him is kept tightly under wraps by the society.

00:20:24.540 --> 00:20:30.850
I believe it may have something to do with the top brass of 15 years ago.

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:32.550
I will look into it further.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:34.000
Please do.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.210
Isn't Furumori already 70?

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.680
My master is a lot younger, and he's not a criminal.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.740
But he's making you steal.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.280
To achieve our goal!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:48.440
A single individual shouldn't keep Lost Preciouses to himself.

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:51.580
They have to be used for all the people of the world.

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:56.410
I've never seen my master act for his own benefit.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.970
I apologize for the sudden intrusion.

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.150
I wanted to deliver this to you as soon as possible.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:07.930
You shouldn't have. I would have gone to get it.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:12.010
Well, is it really True Love?

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:15.910
Yes. After doing some research I realized a friend had it.

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.470
Please take a look.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.320
What is it? Something good?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.280
Ai.

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:32.340
Ai, I'm glad you're all right.

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:33.510
Master.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:34.630
What?

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:37.340
Ryuji-kun, was it?

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:40.150
Master, I can't get this off.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:43.240
You're Furumori?

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.510
I abandoned that name long ago.

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.600
You're coming with me.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:39.910
"The Truth About Wolves"

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:27.510
I am Ai.

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:29.660
I live with my master.

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:32.790
When I'm bored, I play shiritori by myself.

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:36.210
Ai... Ink... Crayon.

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:39.020
An "N"! I lost!
